/T (Carbohydrates:  Carbs are not. the. enemy. So many diets include cutting out carbs almost completely, claiming that they are the reason people gain weight. Unless your body is in a state of ketosis \(using fats for nergy\), you need carbs to function and survive. They are your main source of energy, especially for workouts. )
