/Title (Yes. You absolutely do not and should not give up your social life for your fitness journey. That being said, it is important to be mindful in these occasions. Alcohol has calories, it affects sleep, recovery, and hunger cues. As long as you are aware of these and account for them within your plan, you have no reason to need to give up a fun night out.)
