/Title (There are 3 main types of calories. These are your proteins, carbs, and fats. Each of them play a crucial role in your body, and it is important to keep your levels balanced. Both protein and carbs have 4 calories per gram, while fats have 9 calories per gram. This will come into play when we calculate how many of each we need.)
